🟩🟩🟩 STDOUT️ 🟩🟩🟩️
Update name or description.

USAGE:
  scw annotations value update [arg=value ...]

ARGS:
  value-id        ID of the value to update.
  [name]          New name of the value. Never use a secret as a name, as it is shown in the audit trail.
  [description]   New description of the value. Never put a secret in the description, as it is shown in the audit trail.

FLAGS:
  -h, --help                help for update
      --list-sub-commands   List all subcommands

GLOBAL FLAGS:
  -B, --beta             Enable beta mode
  -c, --config string    The path to the config file
  -D, --debug            Enable debug mode
  -H, --no-headers       Skip headers in human output
  -o, --output string    Output format: json or human, see 'scw help output' for more info (default "human")
  -p, --profile string   The config profile to use
